{{!-- The empty state shared by every media set surface. It says nothing
      matched, never that the site holds nothing, and it does not restate the
      criteria: the set header directly above already names the set and shows a
      zero count. Five site-wide popular tags follow as a way back into content
      rather than a dead end. --}}
<div class="empty-state">
  <p>No photos or videos found.</p>
  {{#if popularTags.length}}
    <p>Try one of these popular tags:</p>
    <ul class="tag-chip-row">
      {{#each popularTags}}
        <li><a href="{{href}}" class="tag-chip">{{display}}</a></li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
  {{/if}}
</div>
